# Kylox, Visionary Inventor: X is the total power of the sacrificed creatures, and a total below zero is no cards (CR 107.1b).
# Turn 1 Bot1 gives its Ornithopter (0/2) -1/-0 with Take the Fall (drawing a Plains), casts Kylox, attacks and sacrifices the
# Ornithopter: its power was -1, so X is -1 and nothing is exiled - the Lightning Bolt on top of the library stays put.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Kylox, Visionary Inventor
Take the Fall
Plains
Lightning Bolt
Plains x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x10

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Take the Fall.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = -1
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kylox, Visionary Inventor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Kylox, Visionary Inventor > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 6
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Black Lotus; Black Lotus; Take the Fall
